    rdfs:comment """The official name of this dangerous good according to the
							RID chapter 3.2, table A, column 2 Mandatory, except it concerns a
							declaration of an empty packaging of the type "EMPTY PACKAGING", "EMPTY
							RECEPTACLE", "EMPTY RECEPTACLE <=1000L, "EMPTY IBC" or "EMPTY LARGE
							PACKAGING\"""" ;
